either thermally at 40 &#x00B0;C overnight or with &#x3BC;w irradiation
at 60 &#x00B0;C (2 x 10 min). The resin then was filtered and washed with
DMF (6 x 2 min) to extract the released amine. The combined filtrates
were concentrated and freeze-dried in order to determine reaction yield
and product purity. Methyl 6-Amino-6-deoxy-2,3,4-tri-O-methyl-&#x3B1;
-D-glucopyranoside (8). Amine 8 was obtained from 1 (35 mg, 136
&#x3BC;mol, 2 eq) and resin 7 (0.2 g, 0.34 mmol·g-1) using the
catch-and-release protocol as described in procedure A in 89% yield (14
mg). Rf = 0.19 (30:2:1 MeCN-H2ONH4OH); [&#x3B1;]D = +41.6 (c 1.0, MeOH);
1H NMR (300 MHz, MeOD): &#x3B4; 4.86 (d, 1 H, J1,2 = 3.6 Hz, H-1), 3.59,
3.54, 3.49, 3.42 (4 s, 3 H each, OCH3), 3.45 (ddd, 1 H, J4,5 = 10.4 Hz,
J5,6b = 5.7 Hz, J5,6a = 2.7 Hz, H-5), 3.39 (m, 1 H, H-3), 3.20 (dd, 1 H,
J2,3 = 9.6 Hz, H-2), 2.98 (dd, 1 H, H-6a), 2.59 (dd, 1 H, J3,4 = 9.0 Hz,
H-4), 2.71 (dd, 1 H, J6a,6b = 13.2 Hz, H-6b); 13C NMR (75 MHz, MeOD):
&#x3B4; 97.0 (C-1), 83.2 (C-3), 81.6 (C-4), 81.3 (C-2), 71.0 (C-5), 59.6,
59.4, 57.4, 54.1 (OCH3), 42.2 (C-6); ESI-MS: m/z 236.1 [M + H]+, 258.1 [M
+ Na]+, 471.3 [2 M + H]+. Elemental analysis calculated (%) for
C10H21NO5: C 51.05, H 9.00, N 5.95; found: C 51.23, H 9.04, N 5.96.
