$DATUM N-Methyl-N-[N-(4-nitrophenyl)diethoxyphosphorimidoyl]trifluoroacetamide
(IVd): A solution of 0.0643 mol of p-nitrophenyl azide in 10 ml of
benzene was added to a solution of 0.0111 mol of
N-(diethoxyphosphino)-N-methyltrifluoroacetamide (Ic) in 5 ml of benzene.
The mixture was left overnight, the solvent was removed in a vacuum, and
the residue was subjected to a water-jet-pump vacuum. Yellow oil, yield
97%. IR spectrum (CCl4), ν, cm-1: 1715 (C=O), 1320-1350 (P=N). 1H NMR
spectrum (CDCl3), δ, ppm: 1.32 t (6H, CH2CH3, 3J 7 Hz), 3.41 d.q (3H,
NCH3, 3JHP 9.2, 5JHF 1.6 Hz), 4.04-4.32 m (8H, OCH2). 19F NMR spectrum
(benzene), δF, ppm: -71.03. 31P NMR spectrum (benzene), δP, ppm: -8.05.
Found, %: N 11.18; P 8.01. C13H17F3N3O5P. Calculated, %: N 10.96; P 8.08.
