$DATUM 11,17 -Di-tert-butyl-2-tosyIimino-3,2,12-oxadiphosphapentacyclo[11.5.1.02
,11 .0 4,10 .0 12,16)nonadeca-4(10),5,8,14,17-pentaen-19-one (10a): A
solution of 5 (255 mg, 0.62 mmol) and p-tosyl azide (9a; 134 mg, 0.68
mmol) in CH2Cl2 (20 mL) was stirred at r. t. for 2 d. The solvent was
evaporated and the residue was washed with petroleum ether (3 x 5 mL) and
petroleum ether/Et2O (1: 1; 3 mL) to afford the iminophosphorane 10a.
Colorless powder, yield 334 mg, 93%. mp 256-258°C (dec). IR (KBr): v =
3036, 2954, 2928, 2870, 1690 (C=O), 1392, 1362, 1280,1214, 1174,1144,
1120, 666cm-1 . 1H NMR (CDCl3): δ = 1.07,1.19 [each s, each 9 H, C(CH3h),
1.62 [ddd, 2J(H, H) = 12.8, 3J(H, H) = 6.0,6.0,1 H, H 7-ax], 2.28 (s, 3
H, p-CH3 ), 2.92 [ddd, 2J(H,H) = 12.8, 3J(H,H) = 7.5,7.5, 1H, H7-eq),
3.05 [dd, 2J(H, P 12) = 18.0, 3J(H, H) = 5.3,1 H, H 13/16], 3.79 [dd,
2J(H,P12) = 20.3, 3J(H,H) = 4.1, 1 H, H13/16], 4.75 [dd, 2J(H,P2) =24.8,
3J(H,H) = 9.4, 1H, HI], 5.19 [ddd, 3J(H, H) = 7.5, 7.5, 6.0, 1 H, H 8],
5.52 [ddd, 3J(H, H) = 9.0, 7.5, 6.0, 1H, H6], 5.70-5.73 (m, 2H, H18,
H14/15), 6.05 [d, 3J(H, H) = 9.0, 1 H, H 5], 6.37-6.41 (m, 2 H, H 9, H
14/15), 7.14 [d, 3J(H, H) = 7.1, 2 H, m-H), 7.74 [d, 3J(H, H) = 7.1, 2 H,
o-H]. 13C{1H} NMR (CDCl3: δ = 21.1 (s, p-CH3 ), 27.8 (s, C 7), 28.1 [br
s, C 11-C(CH3hJ. 29.1 [s, C 17-C(CH3)3), 37.8 [s, C 17-C(CH3hJ. 37.8 [d,
2J(P, C) = 13.0, C 11-C(CH3h), 42.8 [d, 1J(P, C) = 32.9, C 1/13/16], 50.0
[d, 1J(P, C) = 15.4, C 1/13/16], 54.2 [dd, 1J(P, C) = 62.6,53.1, C 11],
58.0 [d, 1J(P, C) = 47.8, C 1/13/16), 112.8 [d, J(P, C) = 10.9, =CH],
116.6 (s, =CH), 119.9 [d, J(P, C) = 9.1, = CH], 122.7 [dd, 2J(P, C) =
13.3, 7.1, C 10], 122.9 [dd, J(P, C) = 22.2, 12.0, =CH], 124.9 [d, J(P,
C) = 20.3, =CH], 125.4 (s, o-C), 126.4 (s, =CH), 128.8 (s, m-C), 141.2
(s, p-C), 141.7 [dd, 2J(P, C) = 19.1, J(P, C) = 2.4, C 14/15], 142.3 [d,
3J(P, C) = 3.9, ip-so-C], 152.2 [dd, J(P, C) = 3.0, 3.0, C4/17], 153.6
[dd, J(P, C) = 12.4, 6.6, C4/17], 196.5 [dd, 2J(P, C) = 6.1, 6.1, C 19].
31p{IH} NMR (CDCl3): b = -2.4 (s, P12), 47.1 (s, P2). MS (EI, 70 eV): m/z
(%) = 581 (M+ 100), 525 (M+ -C4HS' 53), 376 (M+ -C 7Hs O, 37),205 (M+
-NTos-C 7H6 0-PCBu-t-H, 43). C31H37NO4P2S calc. C 64.02 H 6.41 N 2.41
(581.6) found 62.7 6.6 2.2
