$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 6-(4-Fluoro)benzamino-6-deoxy-1,2:3,4-di-O-isopropylidene-α
-D-galactopyranose (15) 6-Azido-6-deoxy-1,2:3,4-di-O-isopropylidene-α
-D-galactopyranose (12;26 100 mg, 0.35 mmol) and phosphane 4b (117 mg,
0.29 mmol) were dissolved in a DMF-H2O mixture (0.5 mL:0.05 mL) and
heated under microwave conditions (50 Watt) for 20 min. After removal of
the solvent under reduced pressure, the crude product was purified by
column chromatography (PE-EtOAc, 20:1). Colorless syrup, yield 190 mg,
92%. Rf = 0.57 (PE-EtOAc, 4:1). 1H NMR (400 MHz, C6D6): δ = 1.01, 1.13,
1.39, 1.46 [4 s, 3 H each, 2 × C(CH3)2], 3.44-3.52 (m, 1 H, H-6a), 3.81
(dd, 3J3,4 = 7.8 Hz, 1 H, H-4), 4.02-4.07 (m, 1 H, H-6b), 4.15 (dd, 3J1,2
= 4.7 Hz, 3J2,3 = 2.3 Hz, 1 H, H-2), 4.12-4.16 (m, 1 H, H-5), 4.42 (dd,
3J2,3 = 2.3 Hz, 3J3.4 = 7.8 Hz, 1 H, H-3), 5.45 (d, 3J1,2 = 4.7 Hz, 1 H,
H-1), 6.33 (br s, 1 H, NH), 6.64 ('t', 3Jo,m = 3JH,F = 8.6 Hz, 2 H, Hm),
7.55 (dd, 3Jo,m = 8.6 Hz, 4JH,F = 5.5 Hz, 2 H, Ho). 13C NMR (101 MHz,
C6D6): δ = 24.3, 25.0, 26.1, 26.3 [4 × CH3 of C(CH3)2)], 41.2 (C-6), 66.9
(C-5), 71.2 (C-2), 71.4 (C-3), 72.0 (C- 4), 96.8 (C-1), 108.8, 109.3 [2 ×
C of C(CH3)2], 115.3 (d, 2JC,F = 22.1 Hz, Cm), 128.7 (Cipso), 129.7 (d,
3JC,F = 8.8 Hz, Co), 164.8 (d, 1JC,F = 250.4 Hz, Cp), 166.2 (C=O). 19F
NMR (376 MHz, C6D6): δ = -109.5. MS (MALDI-TOF): m/z = 380 [M+ - H].
Anal. Calcd for C19H24FNO6: C, 59.83; H, 6.34; N, 3.67. Found: C, 59.78;
H, 6.30; N, 3.78.
